From e3a09244c0309b814ff0b6ce85908a0d3ba82840 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bobby Ullman <bullman@palantir.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2015 13:49:54 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] generated table code fixes

fixed problems

